# IZZ TUNNELING - STABLE SSH CONFIGURATION (ANTI-DISCONNECT)
Port 22
Port 2222
Port 2223

PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UsePAM yes
AllowTcpForwarding yes
X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd no
PrintLastLog no

# Stability, KeepAlive & Anti-Disconnect Tuning
TCPKeepAlive yes
ClientAliveInterval 30
ClientAliveCountMax 5
MaxStartups 100:30:200
MaxSessions 100
MaxAuthTries 10

Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server
Banner /etc/kyt.txt
